<title>SWEDEN: Swedish 10-yr bond auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swedish 10-yr bond auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of two billion crowns of Swedish 10-year government bonds was oversubscribed, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					 Bond number 1037</p>
<p> Volume issued (billion Skr)	   2.00</p>
<p> Total bids (billion Skr)		4.69</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		    2</p>
<p> Number of bids				39</p>
<p> Lowest rate				6.565</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		  6.565</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		  6.565</p>
<p> Percent served at highest rate     95.24</p>
